    [31287]={name="Draenei Honor Guard Shield",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 404 creature types around level 65-70. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31288]={name="The Master's Treads",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 404 creature types around level 65-70. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31292]={name="Crystal Pulse Shield",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 684 creature types around level 67-72. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31297]={name="Robe of the Crimson Order",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 684 creature types around level 67-72. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31299]={name="The Oathkeeper",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 805 creature types around level 68-72. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31383]={name="Spiritualist's Mark of the Sha'tar",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Battle of the Crimson Watch” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowmoon Valley.",zone="Shadowmoon Valley",questName="Battle of the Crimson Watch",lore="They are probably searching for you on the Path of Conquest as we speak. You must make your escape! Leave me, I'm done for... They... I think I hear them coming."},
    [31426]={name="Agile Mountain Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Bladespire Ogres” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="The Bladespire Ogres",lore="To the north of the Bloodmaul clan lies a threat more grave: Bladespire Hold. The Bladespire ogres are the strongest clan in the mountains, having the favor of the gronn known as Gruul the Dragonkiller, and his seven sons."},
    [31482]={name="Dire Wolf Handler Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Protecting Our Own” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="Protecting Our Own",lore="With the magical dust you recovered, I have fashioned a magic ointment that will aid in our own defenses."},
    [31544]={name="Clefthoof Hide Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Showdown” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="Showdown",lore="Now it comes to this. We will bring Goc forth from his lair, and we will destroy him. With Goc dead, the Bladespire ogres will threaten the Mok'Nathal no longer."},
    [31545]={name="Oilcloth Breeches",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Showdown” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="Showdown",lore="Now it comes to this. We will bring Goc forth from his lair, and we will destroy him. With Goc dead, the Bladespire ogres will threaten the Mok'Nathal no longer."},
    [31691]={name="Natasha's Guardian Cord",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hound-Master” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="The Hound-Master",lore="Baelmon the Hound-Master must die! He maintains the ritual that keeps the portal functioning. The Death's Door portal is located at the north end of the canyon."},
    [31692]={name="Natasha's Ember Necklace",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hound-Master” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="The Hound-Master",lore="Baelmon the Hound-Master must die! He maintains the ritual that keeps the portal functioning. The Death's Door portal is located at the north end of the canyon."},
    [31694]={name="Natasha's Pack Collar",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hound-Master” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="The Hound-Master",lore="Baelmon the Hound-Master must die! He maintains the ritual that keeps the portal functioning. The Death's Door portal is located at the north end of the canyon."},
    [31695]={name="Natasha's Choker",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hound-Master” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="The Hound-Master",lore="Baelmon the Hound-Master must die! He maintains the ritual that keeps the portal functioning. The Death's Door portal is located at the north end of the canyon."},
    [31717]={name="Shadowcast Tunic",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Foot of the Citadel” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="The Foot of the Citadel",lore="Force Commander Gorax is training Shattered Hand captains at the base of Hellfire Citadel, honing them to a bloody razor's edge. You must kill him, for his loss would be a mighty blow to the fel orcs."},
    [31788]={name="Blacksting Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Blacksting's Bane” — pick it over the other choices. In Zangarmarsh.",zone="Zangarmarsh",questName="Blacksting's Bane",lore="I can't blame the first party for leaving, but everyone knows 'twasn't the heat that drove them away. No, it was Blacksting, although they won't admit it."},
    [31797]={name="Elekk Hide Spaulders",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Fallen Exarch” — pick it over the other choices. In Terokkar Forest.",zone="Terokkar Forest",questName="The Fallen Exarch",lore="They are feeding the souls they steal to a coffin that they have dragged out from the Auchenai Crypts. My scouts believe the contents of the coffin to contain the first exarch of the crypts."},
    [32474]={name="Surestrike Goggles v2.0",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [32475]={name="Living Replicator Specs",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [32476]={name="Gadgetstorm Goggles",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [32478]={name="Deathblow X11 Goggles",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [32479]={name="Wonderheal XT40 Shades",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [32480]={name="Magnified Moon Specs",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [32494]={name="Destruction Holo-gogs",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [32495]={name="Powerheal 4000 Lens",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [33241]={name="Oiled Leather Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Catch a Dragon by the Tail” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Catch a Dragon by the Tail",lore="With the zeppelin crash delaying supplies, we've run out of medicines and bandages. We're making use of what we can, but between all the insects, the injuries, and the enemies we're encountering here, I can barely keep up!"},
    [33242]={name="Raptorhide Legguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous",lore="Travelers and Steamwheedle personnel working in the field are advised to avoid the Bloodfen Burrow to the west of town."},
    [33243]={name="Skirmisher's Cover",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Peace at Last” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Peace at Last",lore="I wish we had a way of letting James Hyal's wife and son know that we have brought their murderers to justice. There are some who say that their spirits will know, even if we cannot reach them."},
    [33245]={name="Grimsby's Gaudy Girdle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Cleansing Witch Hill” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Cleansing Witch Hill",lore="The torch is ready. Plant it at the end of the dock and be prepared to face whatever comes forth. I have no idea what the torch's smoke may reveal..."},
    [33247]={name="Swift Wind Spaulders",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Take Down Tethyr!” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Take Down Tethyr!",lore="Sea monster or no, we're not going to risk the safety of our shipping. I've ordered our best marksmen to prepare for a confrontation with this Tethyr."},
    [33261]={name="Destroyer's Cloak",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Direhorn Raiders” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Direhorn Raiders",lore="The Grimtotems up at Direhorn Post, just to the north, are getting bolder by the day. At night, you can often hear them chanting about their deeds in battle against people who've tried to settle here."},
    [33266]={name="Book of the Adept",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Unleash the Raptors” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Unleash the Raptors",lore="Now that we've got our raptors, our next move is to \"encourage\" them to attack the Grimtotems at Blackhoof Village to the northwest. I've got a leftover haunch of..."},
    [33269]={name="Bejeweled Dagger",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Return to Jaina” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Return to Jaina",lore="The ogres here are useful for little more than crude jokes, sour ale, and bouts of headbutting. When my ship, the Dawn Runner, ran aground, those curs from Theramore made off with my cargo and last surviving crewman."},
    [34416]={name="Gloves of the Dune",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rise of the Silithid” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rise of the Silithid",lore="I am entrusting you with a copy of the report Raschal made on the infestation of southeastern Feralas. While the main report is being filed in Darnassus, I want you to give this copy to an associate of the Protectorate."},
    [34417]={name="Marauder's Handwraps",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rise of the Silithid” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rise of the Silithid",lore="I am entrusting you with a copy of the report Raschal made on the infestation of southeastern Feralas. While the main report is being filed in Darnassus, I want you to give this copy to an associate of the Protectorate."},
    [34421]={name="Cave Crawler's Mail Treads",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Future Task” — pick it over the other choices. In Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="A Future Task",lore="Well... we seem to be at an unfortunate impasse. We know what we need - the Plates of Uldum - but we have no idea where they might be. We will research this, and then devise a solid plan of attack."},
    [34423]={name="Strength of the High Chief",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Words of the High Chief” — pick it over the other choices. In Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Words of the High Chief",lore="The Winterfall are no longer a threat to me, but if you still want to find out what was driving the furbolg to create and consume this strange firewater, I think you should seek out Kelek Skykeeper."},
    [34424]={name="Power of the High Chief",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Words of the High Chief” — pick it over the other choices. In Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Words of the High Chief",lore="The Winterfall are no longer a threat to me, but if you still want to find out what was driving the furbolg to create and consume this strange firewater, I think you should seek out Kelek Skykeeper."},
}

